<title>UK: Westdeutsche LB sets warrants on the DAX and MDAX.</title>
<headline>Westdeutsche LB sets warrants on the DAX and MDAX.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westdeutsche Landesbank Girozentrale says it has issued 200 million American-style call and put warrants, in marks, in 20 equal tranches, on the DAX index and on the MDAX index.</p>
<p>There are 10 tranches on the DAX index, five tranches of call and five tranches of put warrants. There are also 10 tranches on the MDAX index, six call and four puts.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	04.OCT.96		  LISTING	   DDF FFT</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
